// PR - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

;; PR is a Lisp whose printing form is `println`. The parentheses are
;; part of the syntax rather than punctuation, which is the whole
;; difference from the other Lisps here.
(println "Hello World!")
